# Useful Wireshark Filters

### Display HTTP traffic

```text
http
```

### Display GET requests

```text
http.request.method == "GET"
```

### Display POST requests

```text
http.request.method == "POST"
```

### Display HTTP requests to a particular host

```text
http.host == "example.com"
```

### Display traffic from a particular IP

```text
ip.addr == 192.168.1.10
```

Replace the example IP with the IP address used in your authorized lab.

